# Nothing in this repo should ever contain a secret, a firmware blob, or a
# device dump. The entries below are the three classes deliberately kept out.

# 1. Firmware and vendor binaries — redistribution is not ours to grant, and
#    they are ~700MB anyway. Fetch them from the upstream project.
*.img
*.img.gz
*.zip
images/
tools/
flashthing-cli
superbird-tool

# 2. Device dumps — eMMC partition images and /var tarballs pulled off the Car
#    Thing. These can contain the previous install's Spotify tokens, Wi-Fi PSK
#    and account state. Never commit them.
backup/
partitions/
*.tar.gz
*.bin
*.ext4

# 3. Live credentials and machine-local state.
wpa_supplicant.conf
*.pem
*.key
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*
auth-session.json
setup-state.json
*.log

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
